  "ruleText": "Mirt 303.10 titled “Eligibility Requirements for Licensure in Computer Tomography.”\n\nThese adoptions necessitated the renumbering of the existing rule Mirt 303.08 titled “Armed Services Education or Experience” as Mirt 303.11, but this rule was not readopted by Document #13329.\n\nDocument #13329 also readopted with amendments Mirt 302.04 titled “Required Documents” and readopted with amendments and renumbered Part Mirt 305 titled “Temporary Licenses” and Part Mirt 306 titled “Post-Graduate Temporary Licenses” as a single Part Mirt 305 titled “Temporary Licenses.” These amendments included the deletion of the following rules:",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/mirt300.html"
